umb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ccfeff74e94acf8fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6320d2bfeaa08d7dEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_MeetingAfter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_MeetingAfter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_MeetingAfter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">68fe0205-c1a2-461a-9c28-e2be4a2a4307</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:68fe0205-c1a2-461a-9c28-e2be4a2a4307\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:68fe0205-c1a2-461a-9c28-e2be4a2a4307\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phubbs\" title=\"Phubbs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/25px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/38px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/50px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Doorman Phubbs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/25px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phubbs\" title=\"Phubbs\">Doorman Phubbs</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-261&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-72</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A hastily written note on the torn-off corner of an invitation]\n</p><p><br>\nYou. Me. A gallon of the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Mermaid's</a> finest swill - sound like a plan?\n</p><p><br>\nMeet me in the usual spot after the toffs have buggered off home.\n</p><p><br>\n- B\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/38px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/50px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oskar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a> was not rescued in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phubbs\" title=\"Phubbs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/25px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/38px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/50px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Doorman Phubbs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png/25px-Portrait_Phubbs.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Phubbs.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phubbs\" title=\"Phubbs\">Doorman Phubbs</a> welcomes guests to the estate and carries this note.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202428\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2185/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30177/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7718/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931133/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,m